| Aspect | Rating |
|--------|--------|
| Behavioral Risk | **Low** – only modifies return handling, not retrieval or generation. |
| Regression Risk | **Minimal** – removal of a redundant call cannot introduce new failures. |
| Implementation Complexity | **Very Low** – ~10 edited lines. |
| Dependencies | None beyond existing imports. |

